================================================================================
DATA & THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
================================================================================

`apps/myctrl` bundles only public-domain and permissive open-license control
catalogs and ID-level crosswalks, alongside an external publisher directory
and gitignored local overlay (`src/data/local/`). Commercial, proprietary,
`CC BY-ND`, `CC BY-NC-SA`, placeholder, and third-party SCF STRM-derived
datasets are intentionally NOT redistributed in this repository.

1. U.S. Federal Public Domain Materials (17 U.S.C. § 105 / CC0 1.0)
   - NIST Special Publications & Catalogs: SP 800-53 Rev 5, SP 800-161,
     SP 800-171 Rev 2 & Rev 3, SP 800-171A & 171A Rev 3, SP 800-172,
     SP 800-207, SP 800-218 (SSDF), CSF 2.0, AI RMF 1.0, AI 600-1
     (https://csrc.nist.gov/, https://github.com/usnistgov/OSCAL)
   - FedRAMP Rev 5 baselines, FedRAMP 20x Key Security Indicators (KSIs),
     requirements, and glossary (GSA FedRAMP, https://github.com/FedRAMP/rules)
   - DoD SRG, DoD Zero Trust Architecture & Roadmap, DISA Kubernetes STIG,
     DoD CMMC 2.0 & CMMC Level 1 / Assessment Objectives, DoD Cyber Exchange
     CCI <-> NIST SP 800-53 crosswalk, SPARTA (Aerospace Corporation / DoD)
   - CISA Cybersecurity Performance Goals (CPGs), SSDAF, Secure by Design,
     DHS TIC 3.0, Executive Order 14028, FBI CJIS Security Policy
   - U.S. federal regulations & statutory materials: HIPAA Security Rule &
     Simplification, 45 CFR 155.260, GLBA (16 CFR 314), SEC Cybersecurity Rule,
     FIPPs, U.S.-EU Data Privacy Framework (US DPF)
   - NIST OLIR Public-Domain ID Crosswalks (`csf-nist-crosswalk.json`,
     `csf-pci-crosswalk.json`, `csf-iso-crosswalk.json`,
     `cis-csf-crosswalk.json`, `cmmc-nist171-crosswalk.json`,
     `cci-nist-crosswalk.json`, `eu-ai-act-airmf-crosswalk.json`): contain
     factual identifier-to-identifier mappings from NIST OLIR / CSRC and
     public-domain sources only, without reproducing proprietary control text.

