   - U.S. state cybersecurity & privacy frameworks: TX-RAMP (Texas DIR),
     NY DFS 23 NYCRR 500, California CCPA, Virginia CDPA, Texas TDPSA /
     SB 2610, Oregon CPA, Tennessee IPA, Nevada Gaming Regulation 5.260,
     FERC/NERC CIP, FCA CRM
   - European Union legislation & official texts (published in EUR-Lex,
     exempt from copyright or freely reusable per EU public-document rules):
     GDPR, NIS2 Directive, EU AI Act, EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA) & Annexes,
     EU DORA
   - National & international governmental frameworks indexed for reference:
     UK CAF, UK DEF STAN 05-138, Spain ENS, Saudi Arabia PDPL & IoT
     Guidelines, UAE NIAF, India DPDPA & SEBI CSCRF, China Cybersecurity Law,
     New Zealand HISF & HISF Suppliers, Canada OSFI B-13, IMO Maritime Cyber Risk

